.TH mnnn-review-suggest 1  "mnnn-review-suggest 2.15.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-review\-suggest \- Suggest a change: replace the \-\-at text, or the whole field, with \-\-to
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn review suggest\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] <\fB\-\-to\fR> [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-why\fR] [\fB\-\-field\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-at\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-nth\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-entry\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREVIEW\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Suggest a change: replace the \-\-at text, or the whole field, with \-\-to
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TO>\fR
The new text (or value)
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\-\-to is JSON (a number, list…; for record fields)
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-why\fR \fI<WHY>\fR [default: ]
Why
.TP
\fB\-\-field\fR \fI<FIELD>\fR
The field (body, title, name, description, query, a record field…)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI<AT>\fR
Anchor on this text of the field
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-nth\fR \fI<NTH>\fR [default: 1]
Which occurrence of \-\-at (1\-based)
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-entry\fR \fI<ENTRY>\fR
Journal reviews: the entry (an id or id prefix)
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREVIEW\fR>

.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.15.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
